# Constellations Implementation Plan - Phase 2+ Update

## Overview

This document updates the implementation plan from **Phase 2 onwards** to align with the new frontend design in [front.html](file:///Users/shaunakbhardwaj/Work/constellations/front.html). Phase 1 (Weeks 1-3) has been completed and covers critical fixes, architecture, and data integrity.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This update introduces a major new feature: **Autonomous Agent System** that was not in the original plan. The frontend shows goal-based autonomous processing with LLM integration.

---

## Gap Analysis: Frontend vs Current Plan

### Features in front.html NOT covered in current plan:

| Feature | Frontend Location | Current Plan Status |
|---------|-------------------|---------------------|
| Sidebar-based Navigation UI | Layout | Not covered (plan had GalaxyCanvas) |
| Goals System (CRUD) | Home Panel | Not covered |
| Goal-based Autonomous Agent | Autonomous Panel | Only "hooks" mentioned in M9 |
| Progress/Planning Cards | Autonomous Panel | Not covered |
| User Guidance Input | Autonomous Panel | Not covered |
| Recent Files List | Home Panel | Partially covered |
| Time-of-day Greeting | Home Panel | Not covered |
| File Table with Model Info | Files Panel | Partially covered in M7 |

### Features in plan that appear in frontend:
- ✓ Embedding model selection (Settings)
- ✓ API key management (Settings)
- ✓ Brain directory config (Settings)
- ✓ Semantic search (Search Panel)
- ✓ File upload/drop zone (Files Panel)

---

## Revised Phase Structure

| Phase | Duration | Focus |
|-------|----------|-------|
| **Phase 1** ✅ | Weeks 1-3 | Foundation (COMPLETED) |
| **Phase 2** | Weeks 4-5 | UI Redesign + Settings System |
| **Phase 3** | Weeks 6-8 | Goals + Autonomous Agent Core |
| **Phase 4** | Weeks 9-10 | LLM Integration + Advanced Autonomous |
| **Phase 5** | Weeks 11-12 | Performance, Testing & Polish |

**Total estimated time**: 12 weeks (up from 9 weeks)

