| Agent Status | AutonomousAgent | agent-start/pause/stop/state |
| Guidance Input | GuidanceProcessor | agent-guidance |
| Progress Cards | AgentExecutor (events) | agent-state-update (event) |
| Planning Cards | AgentPlanner | agent-state-update (event) |
| Settings | ConfigService + Secrets | get/update-settings |
| Model Select | ModelCatalog | get-models, set-active-model |
| API Keys | SecretsManager | set/get/delete-api-key |
| Recent Files | FilesService | get-recent-files |

